OL,3,AHouthis 'take control' of key island in
OL,4,Aglobal shipping route, Yemeni
OL,5,Agovernment source tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia has relied on the Red Sea
OL,8,Ffor oil exports since the US and
OL,9,FIsrael's war effectively closed the
OL,10,FStrait of Hormuz
OL,12,FAt least 46,000 people have been
OL,13,Fdisplaced in Yemen since fighting
OL,14,Fescalated last week, according to the
OL,15,FInternational Organization for
OL,16,FMigration
